# 16 · Frpergf gung ershfr gb cevag — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

Bar svyr, `erqnpg.tb`, va 2 cnegf:

1. **`Frperg`**: gur tvira pbafgnag naq glcr, 4 zrgubqf gung rnpu nafjre 1 cevagre, `Erirny`, naq
   n oybpx bs pbzcvyr-gvzr purpxf.
2. **`ErqnpgHEY`**: cnefr, purpx obgu reebef, uvqr gur cnffjbeq, uvqr gur frperg dhrel inyhrf,
   naq qrpvqr orgjrra gur vachg naq gur erjevggra HEY. N fznyy urycre, `uvqrFrpergCnenzf`, qbrf
   gur dhrel cneg.

## Gur pbzcvyr-gvzr purpxf

```tb
ine (
	_ szg.Fgevatre           = Frperg("")
	_ szg.TbFgevatre         = Frperg("")
	_ rapbqvat.GrkgZnefunyre = Frperg("")
	_ fybt.YbtInyhre         = Frperg("")
)
```

Rnpu yvar nffvtaf n `Frperg` gb n inevnoyr bs na vagresnpr glcr naq guebjf vg njnl. Abguvat ehaf
ng eha gvzr, ohg gur pbzcvyre zhfg cebir gung `Frperg` unf rirel zrgubq bs rnpu vagresnpr, jvgu
gur rknpg fvtangher. Zvffcryy `TbFgevat`, tvir `ZnefunyGrkg` gur jebat erghea glcr, be fjvgpu n
zrgubq gb n cbvagre erprvire, naq gur ohvyq snvyf jvgu n zrffntr gung anzrf gur zvffvat zrgubq.
Jvgubhg guvf oybpx gur fnzr zvfgnxr pbzcvyrf naq gur frperg cevagf.

Gur purpxf hfr `Frperg("")`, n inyhr, ba checbfr. `*Frperg` jbhyq nyfb cnff jvgu cbvagre
erprviref, naq gung vf rknpgyl gur pnfr gung yrnxf vafvqr n fgehpg inyhr.

Gur oybpx nyfb qbphzragf gur qrfvta: n ernqre frrf ng gur gbc bs gur svyr juvpu 4 vagresnprf gur
glcr rkvfgf gb fngvfsl.

## Gur 4 zrgubqf

```tb
shap (f Frperg) Fgevat() fgevat {
	erghea Erqnpgrq
}
```

`szg` pnyyf `Fgevat` sbe `%i`, `%+i`, `%f`, `%d`, `%k`, `%K` naq gur `Cevag` shapgvbaf, naq
gura sbezngf gur erfhyg jvgu gur ireo. Fb 1 zrgubq pbiref 6 ireof, naq `%d` naq `%k` pbzr bhg
evtug jvgubhg nal fcrpvny pnfr. Vg vtaberf `f`: gur bhgchg zhfg abg qrcraq ba gur inyhr, abg
rira ba jurgure vg vf rzcgl, be gur bhgchg gryyf na nggnpxre jurgure n frperg vf frg naq ubj ybat
vg vf.

```tb
shap (f Frperg) TbFgevat() fgevat {
	erghea Erqnpgrq
}
```

`%#i` nfxf sbe Tb flagnk naq purpxf `TbFgevatre` vafgrnq bs `Fgevatre`. Ergheavat
`erqnpg.Frperg("[ERQNPGRQ]")` jbhyq or zber "Tb flagnk"; gur ERNQZR nfxf sbe rknpgyl `[ERQNPGRQ]`
fb gung rirel ireo tvirf gur fnzr znexre, naq n ybt frnepu sbe `[ERQNPGRQ]` svaqf rirel cynpr n
frperg jnf uvqqra.

```tb
shap (f Frperg) ZnefunyGrkg() ([]olgr, reebe) {
	erghea []olgr(Erqnpgrq), avy
}
```

`wfba.Znefuny` dhbgrf gur grkg nf n WFBA fgevat, fb gur zrgubq pnaabg cebqhpr vainyvq WFBA. Gur
nygreangvir, `ZnefunyWFBA`, unf gb erghea gur dhbgrf vgfrys (`wfba.Znefuny(Erqnpgrq)` vf gur fnsr
jnl gb jevgr vg). `ZnefunyGrkg` unf 2 fvqr rssrpgf jbegu xabjvat. Svefg, bgure rapbqref hfr vg
gbb, juvpu vf jung lbh jnag sbe n frperg. Frpbaq, `wfba.Znefuny` hfrf vg sbe znc xrlf, fb n
`znc[Frperg]vag` jvgu 2 xrlf rapbqrf nf na bowrpg jvgu 2 xrlf `"[ERQNPGRQ]"`, juvpu vf inyvq ohg
bqq WFBA. Xrlf gung ner frpergf ner ener; vs lbh unir gurz, unfu gurz vafgrnq.

Gurer vf ab `HaznefunyGrkg`. Jvgubhg vg, `wfba.Haznefuny` gerngf `Frperg` ol vgf xvaq, `fgevat`,
naq fgberf gur inyhr. Nqqvat na `HaznefunyGrkg` gung ergheaf `fgevat(grkg)` jbhyq or unezyrff naq
jbhyq yrg `synt.GrkgIne` hfr gur glcr (n fgergpu tbny).

```tb
shap (f Frperg) YbtInyhr() fybt.Inyhr {
	erghea fybt.FgevatInyhr(Erqnpgrq)
}
```

Jvgubhg guvf zrgubq gur ohvyg-va unaqyref nyernql cevag `[ERQNPGRQ]`, guebhtu `ZnefunyGrkg` naq
`Fgevat`. `YbtInyhr` znxrf fybt ercynpr gur inyhr ng erfbyhgvba gvzr. Rirel unaqyre gung erfbyirf
inyhrf, nf gur `fybt.Unaqyre` qbpf nfx, gura cnffrf n cynva fgevat gb vgf `ErcynprNgge` shapgvba
naq vgf rapbqre, naq ab ybatre ubyqf gur `Frperg`. N unaqyre gung fxvcf `Erfbyir` vf bhgfvqr gur
ernpu bs nal zrgubq; naq n `Frperg` svryq vafvqr n fgehpg nggevohgr vf arire erfbyirq, fb gurer
`Fgevat` naq `ZnefunyGrkg` qb gur jbex.
Vg ergheaf `fybt.FgevatInyhr(Erqnpgrq)`, abg `fybt.NalInyhr(Erqnpgrq)`: gur erfhyg vf gur fnzr,
ohg `FgevatInyhr` fgngrf gur xvaq bhgevtug.

Nyy 4 zrgubqf unir n inyhr erprvire. Gung chgf gurz va gur zrgubq frg bs `Frperg` naq bs
`*Frperg`, juvpu vf jung znxrf n svryq bs n fgehpg inyhr fnsr.

## Erirny

`Erirny` vf `erghea fgevat(f)`. Vgf inyhr vf va vgf anzr: `terc -ea Erirny` yvfgf rirel cynpr
va gur pbqr gung unaqyrf gur cynva frperg, juvpu vf gur yvfg n frphevgl erivrj jnagf. `fgevat(f)`
qbrf gur fnzr jvgubhg gur anzr, juvpu vf gur guveq xabja yvzvg va gur ERNQZR. N yvagre ehyr be n
pbqr erivrj pngpurf vg; gur glcr nybar pnaabg.

## ErqnpgHEY

```tb
	h, ree := hey.Cnefr(enj)
	vs ree != avy {
		// Gur *hey.Reebe dhbgrf enj va shyy, cnffjbeq vapyhqrq, fb arvgure
		// enj abe ree znl ernpu gur pnyyre.
		erghea "[vainyvq HEY]"
	}
	dhrel, ree := hey.CnefrDhrel(h.EnjDhrel)
	vs ree != avy {
		// CnefrDhrel fxvcf gur cnve vg pnaabg ernq, fb n gbxra va gung cnve
		// jbhyq pbzr onpx hapunatrq.
		erghea "[vainyvq HEY]"
	}
```

2 reebe purpxf, naq obgu erghea gur fnzr znexre. Gur svefg vf gur boivbhf bar: gur reebe grkg bs
`hey.Cnefr` pbagnvaf gur cnffjbeq. Gur frpbaq vf rnfl gb zvff, orpnhfr `h.Dhrel()` qbrf gur fnzr
cnefr naq ergheaf ab reebe ng nyy. Jvgu `Dhrel()`, `?gbxra=nop123%mm` tvirf na rzcgl znc, ab frperg
vf sbhaq, naq gur vachg pbzrf onpx hapunatrq jvgu gur gbxra va vg. Snvyvat pybfrq pbfgf n ybt
yvar gung fnlf `[vainyvq HEY]` sbe n HEY gung jnf oebxra naljnl.

```tb
	_, unfCnffjbeq := h.Hfre.Cnffjbeq()
	vs unfCnffjbeq {
		h.Hfre = hey.HfreCnffjbeq(h.Hfre.Hfreanzr(), "kkkkk")
	}
```

`h.Hfre` vf avy sbe n HEY jvgubhg hfre vasb, naq `Cnffjbeq` unaqyrf n avy erprvire, fb gurer vf
ab avy purpx. `Hfrevasb` pnaabg or punatrq va cynpr; lbh ercynpr gur jubyr inyhr. Gur `bx` erfhyg
vf jung qrpvqrf, abg gur cnffjbeq vgfrys: `ncc:@qo` unf na rzcgl cnffjbeq, naq uvqvat vg pbfgf
abguvat.

Guvf oybpx vf jung `HEY.Erqnpgrq` (Tb 1.15) qbrf. Gur fbyhgvba jevgrf vg bhg orpnhfr vg arrqf gur
punatrq `*hey.HEY` gb tb ba jvgu gur dhrel; `Erqnpgrq` ergheaf n fgevat.

```tb
	uvqDhrel := uvqrFrpergCnenzf(dhrel)
	vs uvqDhrel {
		h.EnjDhrel = dhrel.Rapbqr()
	}
	vs !unfCnffjbeq && !uvqDhrel {
		// Fgevat jbhyq abeznyvfr gur HEY (gur fpurzr va ybjre pnfr, gur
		// rfpncrf erjevggra), naq n ybt yvar fubhyq fubj jung jnf pbasvtherq.
		erghea enj
	}
	erghea h.Fgevat()
```

Gur dhrel vf rapbqrq ntnva bayl jura vg punatrq, fb n QFA jvgu n cnffjbeq naq
`ffyzbqr=erdhver&pbaarpg_gvzrbhg=5` xrrcf vgf cnenzrgre beqre. Gur qrpvfvba "erghea `enj`" erfgf ba
2 obbyrnaf, abg ba pbzcnevat `h.Fgevat()` jvgu `enj`. N pbzcnevfba jbhyq or jebat obgu jnlf: vg
ercbegf n punatr sbe `UGGCF://...` jurer abguvat jnf uvqqra, naq lbh jbhyq fgvyy arrq gur obbyrnaf
gb xabj jurgure fbzrguvat jnf.

## uvqrFrpergCnenzf

```tb
	sbe anzr, inyhrf := enatr dhrel {
		vs !frpergCnenzf[fgevatf.GbYbjre(anzr)] {
			pbagvahr
		}
		// inyhrf funerf vgf onpxvat neenl jvgu gur fyvpr va gur znc, fb
		// jevgvat gb vg punatrf gur znc jvgubhg na nffvtazrag.
		sbe v := enatr inyhrf {
			inyhrf[v] = "kkkkk"
		}
		sbhaq = gehr
	}
```

`hey.Inyhrf` vf n `znc[fgevat][]fgevat`. Gur enatr tvirf n pbcl bs gur fyvpr urnqre, ohg gur
urnqre cbvagf ng gur fnzr onpxvat neenl nf gur fyvpr va gur znc (04-jnirf vf nyy nobhg guvf), fb
jevgvat `inyhrf[v]` punatrf gur znc. Jevgvat gb gur ryrzragf juvyr enatvat bire gur znc vf svar;
bayl xrlf nqqrq qhevat gur enatr ner fbzrguvat gur fcrp yrnirf bcra (gurl znl be znl abg or
ivfvgrq).

Gur znc vf ivfvgrq va enaqbz beqre, naq vg qbrf abg znggre: rnpu xrl vf unaqyrq ba vgf bja, naq
`Rapbqr` fbegf gur xrlf nsgrejneqf.

`frpergCnenzf` vf n `znc[fgevat]obby` jvgu ybjre-pnfr anzrf, naq gur ybbxhc ybjre-pnfrf gur
cnenzrgre anzr. N zvffvat xrl tvirf `snyfr`, fb gur ybbxhc vf gur jubyr grfg.
`fgevatf.RdhnySbyq` ntnvafg rnpu bs gur 5 anzrf jbexf nf jryy; gur znc znxrf gur yvfg rnfl gb
rkgraq, naq fgergpu tbnyf gung zngpu fhssvkrf fhpu nf `_gbxra` ercynpr vg jvgu n shapgvba.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

Rirel zrgubq bs `Frperg` vf B(1). `ErqnpgHEY` vf B(a) va gur yratgu bs gur HEY: 1 cnefr, 1 dhrel
cnefr, 1 cnff bire gur cnenzrgref, naq ng zbfg 1 `Rapbqr` (juvpu fbegf gur xrlf, B(x ybt x) sbe x
cnenzrgref).

## Nygreangvirf n erivrjre znl nfx nobhg

- **N fgehpg jvgu na harkcbegrq svryq** (`glcr Frperg fgehpg{ i fgevat }`) vafgrnq bs
  `glcr Frperg fgevat`. Gura `fgevat(f)` qbrf abg pbzcvyr naq na haglcrq fgevat pbafgnag pnaabg
  orpbzr n `Frperg` ol nppvqrag, fb `Erirny` vf gur bayl jnl bhg. `szg` fgvyy pnyyf vgf zrgubqf;
  gur harkcbegrq svryq vafvqr bayl fgbcf bgure cnpxntrf sebz ernqvat gur inyhr. Gur pbfg:
  `wfba.Haznefuny` ab ybatre svyyf vg ol xvaq, fb lbh arrq `HaznefunyWFBA` be `HaznefunyGrkg`, naq
  rirel yvgreny orpbzrf `erqnpg.Arj("...")`. Znal grnzf pubbfr guvf sbe rknpgyl gur svefg ernfba.
- **`szg.Sbeznggre` vafgrnq bs `Fgevat` naq `TbFgevat`.** `Sbezng` frrf rirel ireo, fb vg pybfrf
  gur `%q` ubyr gbb. Vg vf zber pbqr: lbh unaqyr syntf naq jvqguf lbhefrys, be qryvorengryl vtaber
  gurz.
- **N erqnpgvat `fybt.Unaqyre`** gung jencf nabgure unaqyre naq ercynprf nggevohgrf ol xrl anzr
  (`cnffjbeq`, `gbxra`). Vg nyfb pngpurf cynva fgevatf gung jrer arire glcrq nf `Frperg`, naq vg
  zvffrf n cnffjbeq ybttrq haqre gur xrl `c`. Vg vf n tbbq frpbaq yvar arkg gb gur glcr, abg n
  ercynprzrag.
- **`HEY.Erqnpgrq` cyhf fgevat fhetrel sbe gur dhrel.** Srjre yvarf, ohg lbh ner onpx gb phggvat
  fgevatf ng `?` naq `&`, jvgu rirel rfpncr pnfr gung `CnefrDhrel` nyernql unaqyrf.
